<%- include('head', { title: 'FAQ | CP Global', desc: 'Answers to common questions about CP Global.', page: 'info', back: '/' }) %>
<section class="sec soft" id="faq"><div class="wrap narrow">
  <span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span>
  <h2 class="big">Good questions.</h2>
  <details><summary>Will Google really show my page first?</summary><p>No one can promise that. A unique username has no competition, and your page is built so Google can read it easily, so it is the best possible start.</p></details>
  <details><summary>What happens after the 3 free days?</summary><p>Your page pauses and comes off Google unless you pick a plan. Your username stays reserved for you.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Who can see my details?</summary><p>Only what you switch on. Date of birth is never shown, and a photo only goes public after it is verified.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Can anyone take my username?</summary><p>No. Once you claim it, it is yours.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Why do I need to verify my face?</summary><p>It keeps CP Global real. Your photo only reaches Google after a quick face check, so nobody can pose as you.</p></details>
  <details><summary>What happens when I change my photo?</summary><p>The new photo is hidden from Google until you verify again. You will see a notice before you upload.</p></details>
  <details><summary>How often can I change my username?</summary><p>Twice, any time. After that, once every 30 days. Your old link and QR code stop working when it changes.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Do you keep my selfies?</summary><p>No. They are deleted as soon as we decide. We keep only the result.</p></details>
</div></section>
<%- include('foot') %>
